 ## Running Tests
 
+### Storage and concurrency regressions
+
+```bash
+dotnet run --project Tests/Tests.csproj -- storage
+```
+
+Run this command from the repository root. These assertions cover uncached
+concurrent SSTable reads/enumeration, invalid persisted block handles,
+compacted values/updates/deletion across a clean reopen, and concurrent
+skip-list insertions and phased updates. A failed assertion exits nonzero.
+The `functional` and default suites also run these regressions. For just the
+skip-list scenario, use the `skiplist` argument.
+
+This is bounded correctness testing. It does not establish crash-safe manifest
+publication, per-write fsync durability, or safe compaction with arbitrary
+concurrent writers. The older timing output is not a validated throughput claim.
+
 ### Run All Tests
 ```bash
 cd Tests
